msgid "{hedge}Creating the MR branch stopped on the scratch branch \"{scratch_branch}\". {resolve}\n{abort}\nOnce \"Continue\" has applied the remaining commits, \"Next Steps\" in the Git Graph's \"MR Box\" updates the MR branch and goes back to the original branch."
msgstr "{hedge}La creación de la rama de MR se detuvo en la rama temporal \"{scratch_branch}\". {resolve}\n{abort}\nUna vez que \"Continuar\" haya aplicado los commits restantes, \"Pasos siguientes\" en la \"Caja de MR\" del grafo de commits actualiza la rama de MR y vuelve a la rama original."

msgid "{hedge}Rewriting commits stopped on the scratch branch \"{scratch_branch}\". {resolve}\n\"Abort\" goes back to the original branch \"{origin_branch}\" and deletes this scratch branch (the partly rewritten commits stay only in git reflog).\nIf you carry on with \"Continue\", you have to move the original branch onto the result yourself (git rebase --onto)."
msgstr "{hedge}La reescritura de commits se detuvo en la rama temporal \"{scratch_branch}\". {resolve}\n\"Anular\" vuelve a la rama original \"{origin_branch}\" y elimina esta rama temporal (los commits reescritos parcialmente solo quedan en git reflog).\nSi sigue con \"Continuar\", tendrá que mover manualmente la rama original al resultado (git rebase --onto)."

msgid "{hedge}Rewriting commits stopped on the scratch branch \"{scratch_branch}\". {resolve}\nThe original branch is unknown, so \"Abort\" does not go back to it. Switch to it yourself after aborting."
msgstr "{hedge}La reescritura de commits se detuvo en la rama temporal \"{scratch_branch}\". {resolve}\nNo se conoce la rama original, así que \"Anular\" no vuelve a ella. Cambie a ella manualmente después de anular."

